    "title": "Analytics Enablement Lead (Information Technology Specialist III)",
    "excerpt": "<p>The Office of Data and Innovation is looking for an Analytics Enablement Lead to join our CalData team. As the Analytics Enablement Lead, you are a senior technical expert who helps California state agencies build up their business intelligence (BI) and analytics capabilities. Reporting to the Deputy Director of Advanced Analytics and Evaluation, you will &#8230; <a title=\"Analytics Enablement Lead (Information Technology Specialist III)\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/join-us/analytics-enablement-lead-information-technology-specialist-iii/\" aria-label=\"More on Analytics Enablement Lead (Information Technology Specialist III)\">Read more</a></p>\n",
